# Wave U (2026-08-27): the Maillard-path hold-out's FROZEN predictions. This one is
# not merely "reviewable without a run" — it is a PRE-REGISTRATION. Its entire
# function is that it records what the model predicted on twelve unseen literature
# systems at a NAMED git commit, before any rate-calibration wave saw them. An
# untracked pre-registration is not a pre-registration: there would be nothing
# stopping a later wave from regenerating it after calibrating and comparing it to
# itself. It must be in git history.
!results/validation/maillard_path_holdout_frozen_predictions.json
!results/validation/maillard_path_holdout_frozen_predictions.md
# Wave H evidence artifacts (2026-08-27): the two refits and the family-implementation
# enumeration are cited from source comments and from the README, so they must be
# reviewable without a run.
